@prefix ex: <http://example.org/> .
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .
@prefix mf: <http://www.w3.org/2001/sw/DataAccess/tests/test-manifest#> .
@prefix n3t: <http://example.org/n3/test#> .
<> a mf:Manifest ; mf:entries ( <http://example.org/n3/unterminated-string-negative> ) .
<http://example.org/n3/unterminated-string-negative> a n3t:NegativeSyntax ; mf:name "unterminated-string-negative" ; mf:action [ n3t:sourceDocument <case.n3> ] ; mf:result n3t:Failure ; mf:status n3t:proposed ; rdfs:comment """The string literal opened after ex:p is never terminated before end of document; every conforming parser must refuse the document, not recover it.""" .
